        <detaileddescription>
<para>Evaluates failure criteria -1 to 4 without the explicit consideration of pore pressure (note that this works for fluid-saturated porous media as well, if the computed stresses are already effective stresses.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>Since this approach is based on civil engineering concepts, tensile stresses are treated as positive and compressive ones as negative. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
